    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεχ-ώϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεχώ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to childbed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1014
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. δῶρα</span> presents <i>made
