			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> neut. as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ρείης . . λεχώϊον</span>
			<i>the place where</i> Rhea <i>bare her child</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Jov.</u>
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
